57 year old Ukrainian woman from her son

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:50.063
speaking through a translator

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.432
for the men.

00:03:52.432 --> 00:03:53.800
In January of this year.

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.268
They came for me.

00:03:55.268 --> 00:03:57.136
All right.

00:03:57.136 --> 00:03:57.971
