00:04:24.831 --> 00:04:25.732
by your officers count,

00:04:25.732 --> 00:04:27.467
including torture,

00:04:27.467 --> 00:04:28.334
murder, rape,

00:04:28.334 --> 00:04:29.602
the forced deportation

00:04:29.602 --> 00:04:31.871
