00:06:21.914 --> 00:06:22.982
Is a clear

00:06:22.982 --> 00:06:25.618
sign, a clear example of our support

00:06:26.352 --> 00:06:26.919
with regard

00:06:26.919 --> 00:06:30.123
to making the highest Russian political

00:06:30.123 --> 00:06:32.158
and military leadership accountable

00:06:32.158 --> 00:06:33.626
for the crime of aggression,

00:06:33.626 --> 00:06:34.861
the leadership crime?

00:06:34.861 --> 00:06:36.295
Because if crime of aggression

00:06:36.295 --> 00:06:37.764
would not have been committed,

00:06:37.764 --> 00:06:40.500
there would be no 80,000 incidents

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:41.768
