00:06:49.108 --> 00:06:51.144
We all know that he will face

00:06:51.144 --> 00:06:52.211
accountability.

00:06:52.211 --> 00:06:54.113
We will do anything possible.

00:06:54.113 --> 00:06:56.215
And our task as a lawyers

00:06:56.215 --> 00:06:58.050
is to prepare everything,

00:06:58.050 --> 00:06:59.185
to prepare cases,

00:06:59.185 --> 00:07:00.787
to collect evidence

00:07:00.787 --> 00:07:02.889
and to prepare our legal framework.

00:07:03.089 --> 00:07:06.793
It's not our we have no time actually

00:07:06.793 --> 00:07:08.628
to think about the future,

00:07:08.628 --> 00:07:10.730
whether we will capture him or not.

00:07:10.997 --> 00:07:12.298
But I will

00:07:12.298 --> 00:07:13.366
give you an example

00:07:13.366 --> 00:07:15.735
of our senior advisers

00:07:15.735 --> 00:07:17.370
from all over the world

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:19.238
who started as young prosecutors

00:07:19.238 --> 00:07:22.909
in cases in tribunals for future

00:07:23.176 --> 00:07:26.712
