00:07:33.453 --> 00:07:34.921
would be in the dock

00:07:34.921 --> 00:07:36.355
of international tribunals

00:07:36.355 --> 00:07:37.957
when they started their work.

00:07:37.957 --> 00:07:39.592
But at the end of the day,

00:07:39.592 --> 00:07:42.361
both of them were tried and prosecuted.

00:07:42.662 --> 00:07:44.597
So our aim together

00:07:44.597 --> 00:07:46.399
with the International Criminal Court

00:07:46.399 --> 00:07:49.168
is to go to go ahead

00:07:49.402 --> 00:07:51.370
not only against Putin,

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:52.972
but also against other

00:07:52.972 --> 00:07:54.607
high ranking officials

00:07:54.607 --> 00:07:55.208
who are

00:07:55.274 --> 00:07:56.576
who are responsible

00:07:56.576 --> 00:07:58.778
for the thousands of war crimes

00:07:58.778 --> 00:07:59.812
