00:08:06.519 --> 00:08:08.154
Ben Wallace, Here's

00:08:08.154 --> 00:08:09.322
a little bit of what he told me

00:08:11.591 --> 00:08:12.358
Does Ukraine

00:08:12.358 --> 00:08:12.725
have what

00:08:12.725 --> 00:08:14.927
it needs for the counteroffensive?

00:08:14.927 --> 00:08:17.730
And why isn't the UK providing

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:20.066
Ukraine with typhoon jets right now

00:08:20.066 --> 00:08:21.868
