00:08:21.868 --> 00:08:23.970
Well, I think, first of all,

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:25.972
Ukraine is getting ready

00:08:25.972 --> 00:08:27.440
and is receiving

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:28.808
the supplies that it needs,

00:08:28.808 --> 00:08:30.610
whether that is artillery shells

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:31.644
or whether that is specialist

00:08:31.644 --> 00:08:33.079
anti-air equipment.

00:08:33.079 --> 00:08:34.981
The huge amount has been donated

00:08:34.981 --> 00:08:36.349
over the last year,

00:08:36.349 --> 00:08:37.884
and that is building to a

00:08:37.884 --> 00:08:40.253
significant capability.

00:08:40.253 --> 00:08:41.821
He says Ukraine is receiving

00:08:41.821 --> 00:08:43.523
the supplies that it needs.

00:08:43.523 --> 00:08:46.292
Are you receiving everything you need?

00:08:46.292 --> 00:08:49.562
I don't think that anyone in Ukraine

00:08:49.862 --> 00:08:50.396
can say

00:08:50.396 --> 00:08:52.999
that we receive everything we need.

00:08:53.599 --> 00:08:55.401
We understand that we need more

00:08:55.401 --> 00:08:59.005
and we need it quicker in order to

00:09:00.006 --> 00:09:01.407
liberate our territory

00:09:01.407 --> 00:09:02.375
as soon as possible

00:09:02.375 --> 00:09:05.444
because it will save lives of our people.

00:09:05.511 --> 00:09:08.314
Because every day more people are killed

00:09:08.581 --> 00:09:10.683
and not only actually

00:09:10.683 --> 00:09:12.552
we're talking about civilians,

00:09:12.552 --> 00:09:15.121
let's also think about our servicemen

00:09:15.755 --> 00:09:18.591
because they are protecting our country.

00:09:18.591 --> 00:09:20.793
They are defending our country. But

00:09:21.961 --> 00:09:22.762
they are

00:09:22.762 --> 00:09:23.596
victims of

00:09:23.596 --> 00:09:25.364
