00:09:25.364 --> 00:09:27.333
committed by Russian Federation.

00:09:27.333 --> 00:09:29.502
And as quick as we liberate

00:09:29.502 --> 00:09:32.204
our territory, more lives will be saved,

00:09:32.238 --> 00:09:34.140
not only civilians, but servicemen,

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:36.242
because many of these servicemen,

00:09:36.475 --> 00:09:38.678
they are civilians yesterday. Right.

00:09:38.711 --> 00:09:40.313
And it's about their families.

00:09:40.313 --> 00:09:41.480
And their lives.

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:44.150
So we are grateful for any assistance

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:44.850
we have.

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:45.952
But I think that we

00:09:45.952 --> 00:09:47.320
need more and quicker.

